@ShippingRatesCalculation_HostAddress = http://localhost:5078
 
### Calculate Rate (Standard, Local)
GET {{ShippingRatesCalculation_HostAddress}}/api/rates/calculate?weight=10&length=20&width=15&breadth=10&serviceType=Standard&destinationZone=Local
Accept: application/json

### Calculate Rate (Express, International)
GET {{ShippingRatesCalculation_HostAddress}}/api/rates/calculate?weight=5&length=30&width=20&breadth=15&serviceType=Express&destinationZone=International
Accept: application/json
